WEBVTT

00:15:00.047 --> 00:15:04.827
It matters to me that young men and women
right across the country

00:15:04.851 --> 00:15:08.691
can imagine for themselves
that they, too, can be and are

00:15:08.715 --> 00:15:11.047
part of the story of our nation.

00:15:11.961 --> 00:15:14.863
I want to challenge them to build a nation

00:15:14.887 --> 00:15:19.794
where three-year-olds
like my daughter, Yie Amie,

00:15:19.818 --> 00:15:22.400
can grow up in good governance,

00:15:22.424 --> 00:15:24.115
quality education,

00:15:24.139 --> 00:15:25.306
health care

00:15:25.330 --> 00:15:27.070
and good infrastructure.

00:15:28.031 --> 00:15:31.959
I want our children
to become young men and women